        "tree": {
            "0": {
                "text": "Phewh, talk about a legendary feat! I would be proud to fight alongside you, should the situation call for it. My sister is in good hands.",
                "choices": {
                    "0": {
                        "text": "Helga and I, we’re not…",
                        "tree": {
                            "0": {
                                "text": "Together? Of course not! But knowing you’re out there working alongside her, and that you can handle yourself in the most dire of situations is exactly the kind of confidence I need. Here, take this, Dram, your earnings off the hides I will sell. See you around my friend."
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "indicator": "dialog"
